{
  "method": "Asset-specific, recency-weighted historical price-direction hit rates conditional on trend, 20-bar return and range position. A regime rate is shrunk toward the asset's recent base rate; require 24 completed historical outcomes and six regime examples, and forecast only if the estimated score is >=55%. Historical outcomes must complete strictly before the signal. No parameters are tuned on the test years. Compare with previous model on identical 2020-2026 eligible observations.",
  "limitations": [
    "Exploratory experiment after inspecting prior results; not untouched or prospective. Overlapping outcomes and common market shocks limit effective sample size; intervals do not account for research selection.",
    "Uses current-listing historical data and excludes most delisted assets. Targeted observation builder requires six- and twelve-month references even though this rule uses only chart-window features.",
    "Price direction is not trading return; no dividends, costs, taxes, slippage, or executable close assumed. Yahoo crypto differs from Binance; no live integration or current model fitting has been validated."
